==Battleground==
*10 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
*3 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Ritual Drum Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**2 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 22.2 seconds<sup>666f</sup>.
**5 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage isn't difficult to beat either despite the appearance of Shy Boy. Rushing the stage with [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] will do the trick. Your cats being frozen by the boss might be a little annoying though.

